testDateTimeHelpers;req;r;days;ymd;micros;hmsu
⍝ Isolated test for date/time helper wrappers.

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Date/Time Helper Wrappers'

days←toDate 2026 1 1
r,←⊂'toDate(2026 1 1) returned non-zero days' req days≠0
ymd←fromDate days
r,←⊂'fromDate(toDate(...)) roundtrip' req (2026 1 1)≡ymd
r,←⊂'isFiniteDate(days) true' req 1=isFiniteDate days

micros←toTime 1 2 3 4005
r,←⊂'toTime(1 2 3 4005) returned micros' req micros>0
hmsu←fromTime micros
r,←⊂'fromTime(toTime(...)) roundtrip' req (1 2 3 4005)≡hmsu
r,←⊂'isFiniteTimestamp(micros) true' req 1=isFiniteTimestamp micros

⎕←↑r
⎕←''
⎕←'Date/time helper wrapper testing complete!'

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
